      "supporting_excerpt": "Steel is an important component in motive power batteries, specifically for the trays that house the battery cells... The recent 25% tariff on imported steel has significant implications for battery manufacturing costs.","relevance_explanation": "Discusses steel tariffs affecting battery trays but does not confirm Section 232 applicability to aluminum enclosures or specific company exposure.","company_applicability": "not_established","temporal_status": "source_reports_effective_as_of_source_date"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "passage_8f3a2329fc3907aa6ac08974",
      "supporting_excerpt": "EV battery enclosures and structural components rely on aluminum extrusions... The 10% tariff on aluminum imports has increased costs for extrusions by 8-12%... OEMs are forced to source from a limited number of US-based extruders.","relevance_explanation": "Confirms cost impact of aluminum tariffs on EV battery enclosures but does not specify Section 232 applicability or named company exposure.","company_applicability": "not_established","temporal_status": "source_reports_effective_as_of_source_date"
    },
